  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. Cut Japanese tofu into 1cm cubes. Set aside.\n• Grate carrot. Thinly slice pear. Set aside.\n• In a medium bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix and garlic aioli. Season to taste. Set aside. TIP: Prepping the slaw first allows the cabbage to soften slightly by the time you're ready to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227a5b260255ff8102e12d/step-83e3e5ea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine garlic, the honey, katsu paste, mixed sesame seeds and a dash of water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227a5b260255ff8102e12d/step-286115ee.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, turning often, until browned, 2-4 minutes. Add katsu mixture and cook, turning tofu to coat, until slightly sticky, 1-2 minutes.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through. TIP: Cook tofu in batches for best results, returning all tofu to pan before adding katsu mixture!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227a5b260255ff8102e12d/step-005ef4e2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely slice long chilli (if using).\n• Fill tortillas with creamy slaw, pear, carrot and katsu glazed tofu.\n• Sprinkle with chilli and crushed peanuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227a5b260255ff8102e12d/step-96b9b91b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
